  "notes": "Classic Jerusalem-stone house, ashlar sandstone blocks (#cfc3a8) with a steep gabled roof clad in tan clay tiles (#c9a86a). Small grilled ground/half-basement windows and larger upper windows (#4a5158); pale entry door under a small flat canopy reached by steps. Frontage: rubble-stone base wall (#c2b19a) with a grey panel vehicle gate and a black barred pedestrian gate, plus a red paved forecourt. Colours pixel-sampled from the ref. Environment: tall dark cypress + rounded topiary oak by the gate, a detailed palm and a small topiary on the right with two large green bushes (one flowering yellow) and a terracotta pot; two cars added at the kerb for street richness. 2026-07-05."
